#: lumos.core.param.Setting.encode:1 of
msgid ""
"Return the JSON form of ``value`` (settings are JSON values; subclasses "
"may override)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.param.Setting.decode:1 of
msgid "Return the value of the JSON form ``data`` (inverse of :meth:`encode`)."
