"Spawn key of the random stream of an element (or identifier): the UTF-8 "
"bytes of its identifier."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.context.Context.rng:1 of
msgid ""
"Return a new generator of the reproducible random stream of an element "
"(or identifier)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.context.Context.rng:3 of
msgid ""
"Streams derive from ``numpy.random.SeedSequence(seed, spawn_key=...)``: "
"they are independent between elements and identical between runs with the"
" same seed."
