"A :class:`Context` holds the graph of elements and everything that is "
"global to a simulation or an experiment: the operating mode (simulation "
"or operation) and the digital twin (REQ-EL-4, REQ-EL-7), the array "
"backend, the observation settings (spectral band, site, pointing; REQ-"
"CTX-6) and the random seed from which every element gets its own "
"reproducible random stream."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.context.Observation:1 of
msgid "Observation settings shared by the elements of a context (REQ-CTX-6)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.context.Observation:3 of
msgid "``(min, max)`` wavelengths of the spectral band, or ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.context.Observation:4 of
